Fixed per-row device lookups in connection-oriented list views: the Console Connections and Power Connections tables now prefetch each port's device; the Interface Connections table (and its canonical `CablePath.interface_connections()` queryset) joins each endpoint's parent device into the endpoint prefetch; and the `Connection` column of console/power port tables now provides tuned prefetch querysets for console/power far-end types (previously only interfaces and circuit terminations), scoped per termination type to the far-end types it can actually connect to.
